Error [jet.ModuleGlobalNotLiteral]: A `#Persist` binding's value must be a literal
  --> tests/ui/module_array_computed_element.jet:1:23
    |
  1 | #Persist bad_table := [Int]{1 + 2}
    |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `#Persist` module global is hot-reload state, which every execution tier initializes from a scalar literal before `run: fn`
 Fix: Use an integer, float, or bool literal, or drop `#Persist` so the build computes the global's starting value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0622
